 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Gandalf the Grey: Izzet Spellslinger",
 "notes": [
  "Plan: chain cheap spells off the card-selection suite, then finish with Guttersnipe, Electrostatic Field or Grapeshot. Gandalf is a bonus, not the plan.",
  "Gandalf's modes can each be chosen once, so the fourth spell forces the library mode; you can send him to the command zone, or leave him on top and redraw him with no tax.",
  "Blinking Gandalf with Ghostly Flicker, Displace, Siren's Ruse or Planar Incision makes him a new object, so all four modes reset.",
  "Two-card infinites: Dualcaster Mage + Twinflame (endless hasty tokens) and Dualcaster Mage + Ghostly Flicker (endless Treasure with Storm-Kiln Artist, endless draw with Archmage Emeritus). Muddle the Mixture can transmute for Twinflame.",
  "Bigger loops: Peregrine Drake + Archaeomancer or Shipwreck Dowser + Ghostly Flicker or Displace (mana); Archaeomancer + Ghostly Flicker + Goblin Electromancer + Sol Ring (endless casts); Archaeomancer + Twinflame + Goblin Electromancer + Storm-Kiln Artist (endless casts).",
  "No board wipes. Interaction is counters, bounce and burn."
 ],
