   "notes": [
    "Dualcaster Mage out: ends both two-card infinites. Young Pyromancer in: another spell payoff.",
    "Twinflame out: ends the Archaeomancer + Storm-Kiln loop. Fire // Ice in: flexible cheap interaction.",
    "Ghostly Flicker out: ends the Sol Ring and Peregrine Drake loops. Fact or Fiction in: card flow. Displace and Siren's Ruse still reset Gandalf.",
